# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit Paulice"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan untuk versi terkini Qiskit Paulice"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Mula-mula, cipta persekitaran minimum yang hanya mempunyai Python dipasang di dalamnya. Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan [persekitaran maya Python](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua cara utama untuk memasang pakej ini: daripada PyPI atau daripada sumber. Kaedah yang diutamakan ialah memasang daripada PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada sumber {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda bercadang untuk membangun dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara setempat, anda harus memasang daripada sumber.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `qiskit-paulice` repository.\n"
msgstr "Mula-mula, klon repositori `qiskit-paulice`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, pasang rantaian alat Rust, naik taraf pip, dan masuk ke dalam repositori. Rujuk [dokumentasi Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) untuk arahan memasang rantaian alat tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-paulice` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah memasang `qiskit-paulice` ke dalam persekitaran maya. Jika anda bercadang untuk menjalankan notebook dan visualisasinya, pasang kebergantungan notebook. Jika anda bercadang untuk membangun dalam repositori, pasang kebergantungan `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Laraskan pilihan di bawah mengikut keperluan anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda telah memasang kebergantungan notebook, anda boleh bermula dengan menjalankan notebook dalam dokumen.\n"
